                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a cool idea, with gorgeous art, you control a wisp that helps the girl get through obstacles, she follows you, and you have to keep her safe and alive. Pretty unique game.\r\n\r\nThe issue is, the controls are super janky. The girl sometimes does things I didn't even tell her to do, resulting in really frustrating deaths. For example I'll just be moving the wisp forward, which should tell the girl to walk/run towards me, but instead she jumps up super high and then falls a long distance to the ground and dies on impact.\r\n\r\nIdea 10/10, execution not so much.",
